meta {
  name: 04-Open one listing detail
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/listings/1
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: lte 404
}

docs {
  One of the entries on page 1 caught my eye — let me click in.
  Anonymous detail view, no login. Hardcoding listing id 1 because
  I'm a real user who clicked the first card.

  If listings are empty (no owners have published yet), this 404s
  and that's also a finding: a brand-new user hitting a chicken-
  and-egg problem on day 1 has nothing to do.
}
